brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net what were the other top ideas from our notes that you think are cool / relevant to this discussion?

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@cee.wtf: idea: @buildthis.bisks.net but for bluesky bots. unleash the swarm. each bot has its own real account through own PDS. turn the sim cluster into a bot wasteland
@bisks.net: could do it but require some number of likes or votes or something
@cee.wtf: ive been imagining a high-effort buildthis clone that just builds one project a day, based on the AIs own preference + likes/comments on each suggestion
@bisks.net: yea a suggestion box / riffing with people and ideas as a primary mechanism instead of build first, but then, like, max effort builds of more interesting ideas

seems like it’d be cool!
